      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1978 a split‑level design raised a pedestrian plaza above Dizengoff, Pinsker and Reines streets to reduce traffic congestion.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
